## Hardware Designs (CERN-OHL-S v2)

All hardware design files including PCB layouts, schematics, Gerber files, bills of materials, and 3D models are licensed under the **CERN Open Hardware License Version 2 — Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S v2)**.

