This hardware design is licensed under the CERN Open Hardware License Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S v2).

You may redistribute and modify this documentation and hardware design files under the terms of the CERN-OHL-S v2.

Source location: https://github.com/Nitheesh-NR-Labs/NODE32_HOME

Full license text:
https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_s_v2.txt

### Summary

- You may use, copy, modify, and distribute the hardware design
- If you distribute modified versions, you must make the modified design files publicly available under the same license
- The license applies to the hardware design documentation, not to products manufactured from it
- This ensures that improvements to the design remain open and accessible to the community

